      "side": 1,
      "message": "Two issues with tracking `isShowingEntireFile`, `richFullContext`, and `fullContextToggledGeneration` separately here:\n\n1. `isShowingEntireFile` is purely derived from `this.prefs?.context` and `this.richFullContext` (`computeIsShowingEntireFile()`), so making it a getter avoids manually syncing it in four places (`diffPreferences$`, `willUpdate`, `reloadDiff`, `handleToggleAllDiffContext`).\n2. `fullContextToggledGeneration` still races with `gr-diff-host.reload()`: `reload()` defers `reloadInternal()` via `debounceP(..., 0)` and then increments `grDiffKey++`, recreating `\u003cgr-diff\u003e` as `UNDECIDED`. Pressing `Shift+X` in that window toggles the outgoing `\u003cgr-diff\u003e` right before it is replaced, while `fullContextToggledGeneration \u003d\u003d\u003d gen` skips resync, leaving source diff out of sync with the button and rich viewer. Passing `showFullContext` down through `gr-diff-host` as a single source of truth (like `lineOfInterest`) resolves both this race and the `changedProperties.get(\u0027prefs\u0027)` check in `gr-diff.ts`.",
